5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, let's get this started. Since we have no information yet, I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely. Try not to be too obvious with your lies; it would make this far too boring.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"I agree. Let us keep a level head and observe. It is far too early to make accusations, but I shall be paying close attention to how each of you carries yourself.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but let's all do our best! I hope we can work together and find the werewolf quickly. Let's have a fun and fair game!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not nervous at all! I'll find the werewolf before they can even think about attacking us. Just don't get in my way while I'm figuring this out.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us maintain a peaceful atmosphere as we begin. I will be listening quietly and reflecting on our conversation.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, such confidence is almost endearing. I wonder if that bravado is a shield for your nerves or a sign of something more sinister. Let's see if your results match your ambition.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. Let us not jump to conclusions so quickly. Confidence is not necessarily a sign of guilt. I believe it is better to listen to everyone before we start doubting one another.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! Let's try to stay positive and get to know each other first. @Takumi, your energy is great! I'm sure we can all help each other out to find the werewolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, it's not a shield! I'm just that good. I don't need to hide anything, so you can keep watching me all you want. I'm the one who's going to save everyone here!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is heartening to see such spirited energy. However, let us remember that haste can sometimes cloud our judgment. I believe a gentle approach will serve us best as we navigate these uncertain waters.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, your ""gentle approach"" is a bit too poetic for my taste. While you're reflecting and Yumi is being positive, the werewolf is likely laughing at us. Let's see who breaks character first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Shunichi, your cynicism is a bit excessive. While I agree we must be vigilant, creating an atmosphere of suspicion this early only helps the werewolf hide. Let us remain patient and observe the patterns.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, don't be so gloomy! I think it's important to trust each other a little bit. If we're all too suspicious, we might accidentally hurt a friend! Let's just keep talking and be honest!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're right! We should trust each other, but I'm still going to be the one to catch the bad guy. @Shunichi, stop being so mean to everyone! It's just making you look suspicious!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, there is no need for such tension. A calm mind sees more clearly than one clouded by cynicism. Let us simply allow the truth to reveal itself in its own time.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems I've become the common enemy. How convenient for the werewolf. I'll keep my eyes on all of you, especially those trying so hard to play the peacemaker. Let's see what the first night brings.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a baseline for today. Let us all reflect on these interactions. I shall be watching for any inconsistencies when we meet again tomorrow.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'll be cheering for everyone to stay safe tonight! I'm really glad we all got to talk a bit. Good luck, everyone, and I'll see you all tomorrow morning!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared of whatever happens tonight! Just remember that I'm the one who's going to win this game for the village. See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a restful and peaceful night. May we wake to a morning that brings us closer to the truth. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
