36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Good morning. I assume we've all had a chance to process the night's events. Since the Seer now has their first piece of information, I'm curious to see who feels the need to speak up first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Indeed. The Seer's knowledge is our most valuable asset. However, we must be cautious; a werewolf may try to claim the role to mislead us. I shall wait and see who steps forward.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I'm actually the Seer! I checked on Shunichi last night, and he's human! I'm so glad he's on our side! Let's use this to find the werewolf together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, really?! That's awesome! I knew you were a good person. @Shunichi, you're lucky Yumi checked you. Now that we know you're human, we can focus on the others. Who should we look at next?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, thank you for sharing your discovery so quickly. It is a relief to know that Shunichi is human. I wonder, do you have any thoughts on who we should prioritize next?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, coming out as the Seer immediately is a bold move. Either you're genuinely trying to help, or you're a very aggressive werewolf trying to seize control of the narrative. I'll trust the result for now, but I'm watching.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, your willingness to reveal yourself so early is certainly helpful, but as I mentioned, we must remain cautious. @Shunichi, your skepticism is noted, but let us see if Yumi's information leads us to the truth.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I know it seems bold, but I wanted to help everyone right away! I really believe we can win if we're honest. I'll keep divining to find the werewolf for us! Who do you think is most suspicious?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@George, you're always so cautious! It's getting annoying. If Yumi says Shunichi is human, then he is! I think we should trust her and move fast. @Jonathan, you've been way too quiet. What do you think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi"",""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I am merely reflecting on the situation. While Yumi's openness is helpful, I agree with George that we should remain mindful. Perhaps we should consider who has the most to gain from this sudden clarity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, you're still playing the philosopher. It's a convenient way to avoid taking a stance. @Yumi, since you're so eager to help, who do you suspect most among the remaining three? Let's see if your intuition matches your boldness.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, please refrain from pressuring Yumi. If she is the Seer, she will provide the information we need in due time. For now, I am more concerned by the haste with which some are pushing for a target.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I don't really have a strong suspicion yet, but I'll do my best! I want to be careful not to make a mistake. Maybe we can talk a bit more to see if anyone seems nervous?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George, stop being so slow! We can't just ""observe"" forever while the werewolf is out there. @Yumi, just pick someone! I'll help you figure out if they're lying. I bet it's someone who's acting all ""calm"" and ""patient.""","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your eagerness to find a culprit is quite striking. While I appreciate your passion, rushing to judgment based on a personality trait can be a dangerous path. Let us not mistake composure for guilt.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your desperation to find a target is becoming quite transparent. It's almost as if you're afraid of a prolonged discussion. @Yumi, if you're the Seer, your hesitation now is interesting. Who will it be?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, you are pushing for a target far too aggressively. @Takumi, your impatience is equally concerning. I believe we should not rush into a vote based on pressure, but rather on evidence. Let us be patient.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, @Takumi, please don't fight! It makes me sad. I really don't want to guess and be wrong. I'll trust my divination for tonight, but for now, let's think carefully before we vote!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@George, you're just making it easier for the werewolf to hide! @Yumi, it's okay to be nervous, but we have to do something! I'm voting for someone who's too quiet. I'm not letting the bad guy win!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your insistence on targeting the quiet among us is quite troubling. Silence is not a crime, nor is it evidence of guilt. I hope we can all find a more rational way to decide.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
